  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your spells scourge your chosen foes.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Bane Spell<sup>GCC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can prepare and cast bane spells that gain the benefits of this feat against an additional number of creature types (and subtypes, if you select humanoid or outside) equal to one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1). Alternatively, if you select only one creature type (and subtype, for humanoids or outsiders) as the focus of your bane spell, the benefits provided by your bane spell are doubled against that creatures of that type (and subtype).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-metamagic-feats#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
